/* Development-only HOT_FORK stories. Consumer defines:
 * HOTFORK_CAPSULE(owner_id, feedback_class, source_tu, story_id,
 *                 fixture_id, adapter_id, max_time_ms,
 *                 forbidden_effect_mask, exercised_surface)
 *
 * The manifest names frozen story authority only. The candidate descriptor
 * is generated after compilation so it can bind the exact object root. */

